            "correction": "Non-repeatable read occurs when a transaction reads the same existing row twice and gets different results due to another transaction modifying/deleting the row between the two reads. Phantom read occurs when a transaction executes the same predicate query twice and gets different result sets due to another transaction inserting/deleting rows matching the predicate between the two queries."
